{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Hamein aur jeene [E]ki chaahat na hoti
[C#m]Hamein aur jeene [E]ki chaahat na hoti
[E]Agar tum [A]na hote, agar [C#m]tum na hote
[C#m]Tumhein dekh ke [B]to lagta hai aise
[B]Bahaaron ka mausam [C#m]aaya ho jaise
[C#m]Dikhayi na deti [E]andheron mein jyoti
[E]Agar tum [A]na hote, agar [C#m]tum na hote
[C#m]Hamein jo tumhara [B]sahara na milta
[B]Bhanwar mein hi [C#m]rehte kinara na milta
[C#m]Kinare pe bhi [E]to leher aa duboti
[E]Agar tum [A]na hote, agar [C#m]tum na hote
[C#m]Tumhein kya bataaun ke [B]tum mere kya ho
[B]Meri zindagi ka [C#m]tum hi aasra ho
[C#m]Main aasha ki ladiyan, [E]na reh reh piroti
[E]Agar tum [A]na hote, agar [C#m]tum na hote
[C#m]Har ik gham [B]tumhara sahenge khushi se
[B]Karenge na shikwa [C#m]kabhi bhi kisi se
[C#m]Jahan mujh pe hasta, [E]khushi mujhpe roti
[E]Agar tum [A]na hote, agar [C#m]tum na hote
